@behscientist

just reserved my copy of #BrainMeetsWorld by 
@behscientist
! I can't wait!!

RT @KHayhoe: What's in a name? A lot! This new survey by 
@YaleClimateComm
 finds that people associate 'natural gas' with 'clean' and 'methane gas' (which is primarily what natural gas is made of) with 'pollution' -- which is what it is. Carbon pollution. https://sciencedirect.com/science/articl...

What's the most beautiful thing you can imagine for our planet? Can't wait to attend the #imagine2200 event hosted by 
@NRDC
 and 
@grist
 with phenomenal authors that include 
@adriennemaree
! https://x.com/NRDC/status/1434258219828977669

You can't have environmental justice without racial justice. You can't have racial justice without environmental justice. (Paraphrasing 
@AsYouSow
). Check out their new scorecard that ranks companies on environmental racism: https://grist.org/climate/as-you-sow-racial-justice-scorecard-exxonmobil/ 
@josephbwinters

Loved #talkingtrash on 
@ToastedEarthPod
! Listen to hear about why recycling isn't the solution to our waste woes and how refill models are one solution to help get us to a more #circulareconomy. Episode drops tomorrow! #zerowaste #EPR https://x.com/ToastedEarthPod/status/1417201587047518208

Grateful that my alma mater nourished me from a little sustainability-obsessed seedling into a sustainability scientist. Thank you for covering my new venture, 
@FurmanNews
! and thank you to @Shi_Institute for all my time spent at the Furman Farm. https://news.furman.edu/2021/06/16/fur
